📊 Bank Credit & Debit Analysis — Tableau
Overview
This module contains the Tableau dashboard created to visualize banking credit and debit transaction behavior.

Tableau is used to create interactive visualizations and communicate business insights through data storytelling.

Objectives
Visualize credit and debit trends.
Analyze customer transaction behavior.
Analyze transaction categories.
Compare branches.
Identify high-value customers.
Create interactive business dashboards.
Dashboard Structure
Dashboard 1 — Banking Overview
